          "value": "The row echelon form matrix $B$ is given below. What are its pivot columns?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & -3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
